">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSMul.hSMul\">•</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> → <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `k * a ≠ k * b` then `k ≠ 0` or `a ≠ b`.","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors.no_nat_zero_divisors","kind":"theorem","line":263,"name":"Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors.no_nat_zero_divisors","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Grind/Module/Basic.lean#L263-L263"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NoNatZeroDivisors</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">∀ {<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u} [<span class=\"fn\">inst</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NatModule\">Lean.Grind.NatModule</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>],\n  <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(∀ (<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>), <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Ne\">≠</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSMul.hSMul\">•</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSMul.hSMul\">•</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> → <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span></span>)</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors\">Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors.mk","kind":"ctor","line":252,"name":"Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Grind/Module/Basic.lean#L252-L263"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">class</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">NoNatZeroDivisors</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NatModule\">NatModule</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Prop</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"We say a module has no natural number zero divisors if\n`k ≠ 0` and `k * a = k * b` implies `a = b` (here `k` is a natural number and `a` and `b` are element of the module).\n\nFor a module over the integers this is equivalent to\n`k ≠ 0` and `k * a = 0` implies `a = 0`.\n(See the alternative constructor `NoNatZeroDivisors.mk'`,\nand the theorem `eq_zero_of_mul_eq_zero`.)","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Module/Basic.html#Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors","kind":"class","line":252,"name":"Lean.Grind.NoNatZeroDivisors","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Grind/Module/Basic.lean#L252-L263"}},{"header":"<div cla